  "title": "Slow Cooker Beef Stroganoff II",
  "description": "A delicious beef stroganoff recipe for the slow cooker. This one uses round steak and golden mushroom soup mixed with egg noodles and sour cream. Very simple to assemble and the slow cooker does the work for you.",
  "authors": [
